Package: usg-plat-verify
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: usg-plat Contributors
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: apt (>= 2.6), coreutils, util-linux, curl | wget, ca-certificates
Description: install-time signature gate for usg-plat packages
 Refuses apt installs and upgrades of platd and usg-plat-verify unless the
 package's SHA-256 is listed in the release SHA256SUMS and that file's cosign
 keyless signature verifies offline against the pinned Sigstore trusted root
 and the exact release workflow identity. Requires an operator-installed
 cosign >= 3.0.3 (/usr/local/bin/cosign by default); without it every
 usg-plat install is refused. dpkg -i bypasses the gate.
